      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now you understand how Russian chefs present new dishes to their brigade. Listen for these culinary compliments next time you watch the episode. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'to chatter' and 'fast' — you will catch every word right away. See you next time!",
